WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
We know how frustrating it can be when
your body keeps your

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.820
plans just out of reach.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:10.120
From busy work days to being out and
about, physical challenges

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.280
have a way of showing up uninvited.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.460
At RehabAI, we're here to help you take
back control, starting

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.600
right from the comfort of your own home.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.680
Using just your phone's camera, RehabAI
tracks your body as

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.640
you exercise, analyzing your body's points
and angles.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.960
Not sure about your phone?

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.520
RehabAI has real-time feedback along with
a live score, so

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.500
you'll know how you're doing every step of
the way.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.860
And after each session, you can look back
at your results and

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.580
watch your progress build over time.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:51.040
Because every little improvement is one
step forward towards doing

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.460
more of what you love.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.820
Download RehabAI and start your next step
today.
